entries[144236] = { ["name"] = "Mantle of the Master Assassin", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped: Legion Legendary (1)\nShoulder Leather\n6 Armor\n+4 [Agility or Intellect]\n+6 Stamina\n+ 2 Haste\n+ 5 Mastery\nDurability 120 / 120\nClasses: Rogue\nEquip: While Stealth is active and for 5 sec after breaking Stealth, your Critical Strike chance is increased by 100%.\n\"Fear not what you can see, but what you can't see. -Mathias Shaw, SI:7.\"\nSell Price:" }
